FamilyTree.person({"id":"bundervoet_livina_1760","name":"Livina Maria Bundervoet","dates":"1760 – 1831 Assenede","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bundervoet","family":"bundervoet","sex":"f","born":"1760","order":"1760","died":"1831 Assenede","line":"bundervoet","father":"bundervoet_petrus_1727","mother":"dedeckere_marie_1731","siblings":[{"id":"bundervoet_annacatharina_1772","weak":true,"note":"rests on her Assenede birth in this household's own commune; no act names her parents"}],"spouses":[{"id":"vervaeck_antonius","name":"Antonius Joannes Vervaeck","detail":"m. Assenede, 1788"}],"source":"paulderidder; Assenede marriage 1788 — Antonius Joannes Vervaeck × Livina Maria Bundervoet","note":"One of the eight children of [[bundervoet_petrus_1727]] and [[dedeckere_marie_1731]]. Their father was\nthe younger brother of [[bundervoet_christoffel_1709]], through whom this tree's line runs, so these eight are\nfirst cousins of [[bundervoet_philippus_1756]]'s generation — blood relatives of Renée and Léon under\nobjective 2.\n\nRecorded first from the paulderidder tree's list of the couple's children. **The Assenede\nregisters now stand behind the death year and add a husband**: her marriage to\n[[vervaeck_antonius]] in **1788**, and her death at Assenede in **1831**.\n\nTwo identifiers agree — the death year 1831, which the held record already carried from a\ndifferent source, and Assenede, where this household is otherwise attested (her father\nburied there in 1777, her sister [[bundervoet_coleta_1766]] born there in 1766).\n\nIndex-level, so `sup`. The marriage act itself would give both their ages and her parents\nin the register's own words."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"bundervoet_livinus_1600","name":"Livinus Bundervoet","dates":"~1600 – ~1651","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bundervoet","family":"bundervoet","born":"~1600","order":"1600","died":"~1651","line":"bundervoet","father":"bundervoet_petrus_1560","spouses":[{"id":"elisabeth","name":"Elisabeth NN"},{"id":"vanhecke_catharina_1620","name":"Catharina van Hecke"}],"source":"paulderidder; glorieuxp","note":"Of Evergem; married twice. His son Segerius (~1615), through whom our line descends,\nwas by his first wife.\n\nCORRECTED (July 2026), on two points, both against the tree this record already cited.\n\n**The surname \"Hovelynck\" is withdrawn.** This record called Segerius's mother\n\"Elisabeth Hovelynck\" and attributed that to the paulderidder tree. That tree records\nher as \"Elisabeth NN\" — a given name and nothing else. Where \"Hovelynck\" came from is\nnot known; it is in no source reachable from here, so it has been removed rather than\nrepeated. She now has her own record as [[elisabeth]], deliberately without a surname.\n\n**The order of the marriages was the wrong way round.** The record had Catharina van\nHecke first and Elisabeth second. The children date it the other way: Elisabeth's son\nSegerius was born about 1615, while Catharina van Hecke (~1620–~1670) is shown in\npaulderidder under \"half-siblings\" as the mother of Wilhelmina Bundervoet (~1650).\nA wife born about 1620 cannot be the earlier marriage of a man whose son arrived in\n1615. Elisabeth is therefore first, Catharina second.\n\nBoth now have records: [[vanhecke_catharina_1620]] and her daughter [[bundervoet_wilhelmina_1650]], along\nwith Segerius's full siblings [[bundervoet_livinus_1615]] and [[bundervoet_maria_1623]]. See also the note on [[vanhecke_willem_1580]]\nabout two van Hecke women marrying into consecutive generations of this family."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"bundervoet_livinus_1615","name":"Livinus Bundervoet","dates":"~1615 – ~1670","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bundervoet","family":"bundervoet","sex":"m","born":"~1615","order":"1615","died":"~1670","line":"bundervoet","father":"bundervoet_livinus_1600","mother":"elisabeth","source":"paulderidder","note":"Full brother of [[bundervoet_segerius_1615]], by [[bundervoet_livinus_1600]] and [[elisabeth]], and\nnamed for his father.\n\nHe is the third Livinus in three generations of this family, which is worth keeping in mind\nwhen reading any record: a Livinus Bundervoet of the mid-1600s at Evergem could be the father\n(~1600-~1651) or this son (~1615-~1670)."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"bundervoet_livinus_1752","name":"Livinus Bundervoet","dates":"b. 1752","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bundervoet","family":"bundervoet","sex":"m","born":"1752","order":"1752","line":"bundervoet","father":"bundervoet_petrus_1727","mother":"dedeckere_marie_1731","siblings":[{"id":"bundervoet_annacatharina_1772","weak":true,"note":"rests on her Assenede birth in this household's own commune; no act names her parents"}],"source":"paulderidder","note":"One of the eight children of [[bundervoet_petrus_1727]] and [[dedeckere_marie_1731]]. Their father was\nthe younger brother of [[bundervoet_christoffel_1709]], through whom this tree's line runs, so these eight are\nfirst cousins of [[bundervoet_philippus_1756]]'s generation — blood relatives of Renée and Léon under\nobjective 2.\n\nRecorded from the paulderidder tree's list of the couple's children, which gives the years\nabove and nothing further. No act has been read for Livinus: a birth act at Evergem\nor Assenede would give the day and the parents in the register's own words."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"bundervoet_marcel_1933","name":"Marcel Henri Bundervoet","dates":"10 May 1933 Oostende – 20 Nov 2015 Oostende","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bundervoet","family":"bundervoet","born":"10 May 1933 Oostende","order":"1933-05-10","died":"20 Nov 2015 Oostende","line":"bundervoet","father":"bundervoet_alphonsus_1905","mother":"bostyn_elodia_1908","spouses":[{"id":"vaniseghem_rosette","name":"Rosette Van Iseghem"},{"id":"bisschop_francine","name":"Francine Bisschop"}],"source":"Familiekunde Vlaanderen Westkust memorial card — Marcel Bundervoet, d. Oostende 20 November 2015; The family itself","note":"Full name Marcel Henri Bundervoet. Confirmed by his memorial card, which named the Bostyn family — pointing to his mother Elodia Bostyn and father Alphonsus.\n\nDATES SHARPENED (July 2026). This record held only the years 1933 and 2015. The\nFamiliekunde Vlaanderen Westkust memorial-card index gives both in full — born\n10 May 1933 at Oostende, died 20 November 2015 at Oostende — and names both partners,\nFrancine Bisschop and a Van Iseghem, which independently confirms the two marriages the\nfamily had reported. Found by harvesting the surname from Open Archives rather than by\nsearching for him.\n\nStill `sup`: the index is a transcription of the card, and nobody here has read the card\nitself. Francine Bisschop still has no record of her own."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"bundervoet_maria_1623","name":"Maria Bundervoet","dates":"~1623 – 1676","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bundervoet","family":"bundervoet","sex":"f","born":"~1623","order":"1623","died":"1676","line":"bundervoet","father":"bundervoet_livinus_1600","mother":"elisabeth","source":"paulderidder","note":"Sister of [[bundervoet_segerius_1615]], by [[bundervoet_livinus_1600]] and [[elisabeth]]. The\npaulderidder tree gives her a birth of about 1623 and a death in 1676; no marriage is recorded\nfor her there, and no act has been read."});
