FamilyTree.person({"id":"coenraets_franciscus","name":"Franciscus Coenraets","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"Coenraets","family":"coenraets","occupation":"winkelier (shopkeeper)","line":"thumas","spouses":[{"id":"godts_anna","name":"Anna Amelia Godts"}],"source":"Marriage act nr. 4 — Franciscus Coenraets × Henrica Thumas, Kraainem, 15 April 1899","note":"Father of the groom in his son [[coenraets_franciscus_1872]]'s marriage act — Kraainem nr. 4, 15 April\n1899 (S27). A *winkelier*, a shopkeeper, of Kraainem, and alive at the wedding.\n\nFather and son carry the same name in full, which is why the son's record says so explicitly:\ntwo Franciscus Coenraets, one act.\n\nHis wife [[godts_anna]] had been dead twenty-four years by then.\n\nFRONTIER: their marriage, roughly 1865–1872 at Sint-Stevens-Woluwe or Kraainem."});
