FamilyTree.person({"id":"dehose_anna","name":"Anna Maria de Hose","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"de Hose","family":"dehose","line":"thumas","spouses":[{"id":"cuypers_antonius","name":"Antonius Cuypers"}],"source":"Marriage of Joannes Athanasius Peremans x Maria Elisabeth Cuypers, Zaventem, November 1844","note":"Named in her daughter [[cuypers_maria]]'s marriage entry — Zaventem, November 1844 (S31), and\nnothing beyond the name.\n\n*de Hose* is an unusual spelling and an unusual name for this corner of Brabant — de Hoze,\nDehose and d'Hooghe are all plausible variants of the same family — which makes her worth\nsearching on her own, and makes the spelling worth keeping exactly as the record has it."});
