FamilyTree.person({"id":"dellaert_guillielma_1650","name":"Guillielma (Willemijne) Dellaert","dates":"1650 – 1694","confidence":"sup","surname":"Dellaert","family":"dellaert","sex":"f","born":"1650","order":"1650","died":"1694","line":"bundervoet","spouses":[{"id":"stockman_joannes_1646","name":"Joannes Stockman"}],"source":"paulderidder","note":"Mother of Livina Stockman (~1688–1744) and so a direct ancestor. Recorded in the\npaulderidder tree with both a Latin form and a vernacular one — Guillielma, called\nWillemijne — in the same style as Joanna \"Janneken\" van Hecke and Joanna \"Janneken\"\nVerbrugghe elsewhere on this line.\n\nShe died in 1694, when Livina would have been about six.\n\nFRONTIER: her parents, and the Stockman–Dellaert marriage."});
