FamilyTree.person({"id":"devriendt_eugenius_1882","name":"Eugenius Alphonsius Devriendt","dates":"b. 13 Apr 1882 Stene","confidence":"doc","surname":"Devriendt","family":"devriendt","born":"13 Apr 1882 Stene","order":"1882-04-13","line":"van-iseghem","father":"devriendt_ludovicus","mother":"brissinck_silvia","spouses":[{"id":"schalandrijn_octavia_1886","name":"Octavia Maria Schalandrijn","detail":"m. Oostende, 10 Nov 1906"}],"source":"gverdievel (Guy Verdievel); Marriage act nr. 258 — Eugenius Alphonsius Devriendt × Octavia Maria Schalandrijn, Oostende, 10 November 1906","note":"Born in Stene; father of Adrienne Devriendt.\n\nUPGRADED (2026-07-26): birth date and place (Stene, 13 April 1882) confirmed by his\nown 1906 Oostende marriage act (nr. 258, S20), read as an image — moved from sup\n(tree-gverdievel) to doc.\n\nGRAFTED (2026-07-26): parents identified from the same act — father Ludovicus\nJosephus Devriendt (already deceased by 1906), mother Silvia Rosalia Brissinck (alive,\npresent and consenting, werkvrouw, living at Steene). See [[devriendt_ludovicus]] and\n[[brissinck_silvia]] for what the act does and does not support about them beyond\nthis.\n\nFRONTIER — three children not yet entered as records (pass-2 material; vrijwilligersrab\nGeboorten index, not read at image level): Ludovicus Josephus (b. Stene 1907-02-07,\nact 7), August Bernard (b. Stene 1909-05-12, act 44), Germaine Marceline (b. Stene\n1920-07-03, act 50). A fourth child, Adrienne Margaretha (b. Stene 1908-04-12), already\nhas a record — see [[devriendt_adrienne_1908]], which now carries her birth act reference (act 29)\nas corroboration."});
