FamilyTree.person({"id":"devriendt_ludovicus","name":"Ludovicus Josephus Devriendt","dates":"d. before 1906","confidence":"doc","surname":"Devriendt","family":"devriendt","died":"before 1906","line":"van-iseghem","spouses":[{"id":"brissinck_silvia","name":"Silvia Rosalia Brissinck"}],"source":"Marriage act nr. 258 — Eugenius Alphonsius Devriendt × Octavia Maria Schalandrijn, Oostende, 10 November 1906; West-Vlaamse Burgerlijke Stand — Huwelijken (marriage index), Rijksarchief Brugge/Kortrijk volunteers","note":"Named as father of the groom in his son Eugenius's 1906 Oostende marriage act (nr.\n258, S20), read as an image — the groom is \"the of-age son of the LATE Ludovicus\nJosephus Devriendt\", so he was already dead by the act date, with no date given\nthere.\n\nFRONTIER — leads from the vrijwilligersrab Huwelijken index, not read at image level,\nso not recorded as fact here: marriage to Silvia Rosalia Brissinck at Stene, 16\nFebruary 1876, act 12; his own parents, Ludovicus Devriendt x Joanna Theresia Trogh.\nEach needs the underlying act image read before it becomes a fact (verification pass,\n2026-07-26)."});
