FamilyTree.person({"id":"goossens_anna","name":"Anna Catharina Goossens","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"Goossens","family":"goossens","line":"thumas","spouses":[{"id":"vandervarent_joannes","name":"Joannes van der Varent"}],"source":"Marriage of Petrus van der Varent x Maria Josephina Peremans, Zaventem, 5 November 1840","note":"Named as a parent of the groom in her son [[vandervarent_petrus_1813]]'s marriage registration —\nZaventem, 5 November 1840 (S29), and nothing more. No age, no dates, no residence in the\nentry, and so none here.\n\nGoossens is a common Brabant surname, which makes her hard to search alone; the pairing with\n*van der Varent* is the handle."});
