FamilyTree.person({"id":"lampsins_maria_1637","name":"Maria Lampsins","dates":"14 Mar 1637 Lichtervelde – 2 Sep 1709","confidence":"sup","surname":"Lampsins","family":"lampsins","born":"14 Mar 1637 Lichtervelde","order":"1637-03-14","died":"2 Sep 1709","line":"bostyn-cappaert","father":"lampsins_paulus_1600","mother":"lampsins_clara_1605","spouses":[{"id":"vansieleghem_josephus_1638","name":"Josephus Van Sieleghem","detail":"m. Lichtervelde, 12 Aug 1657"}],"source":"isavdw — Rijksarchief-sourced, with scan links","note":"Source detail: Geneanet isavdw (correct fiche oc=1)\n\nMother of Clara Van Sieleghem (1666); ten children born in Lichtervelde. Parents Paulus Lampsins (~1600-1659) x Clara Lampsins (1605-1683). The ordinary Lichtervelde Lampsins family — NOT the noble Zwevezele Lampsins namesake avoided earlier."});
