FamilyTree.person({"id":"paelinck_leonie_1901","name":"Léonie (Philomena Leonia) Paelinck","dates":"31 Oct 1901 Sint-Niklaas – 1992","confidence":"doc","surname":"Paelinck","family":"paelinck","born":"31 Oct 1901 Sint-Niklaas","order":"1901-10-31","died":"1992","nickname":"Meme Lenie","line":"de-keyser","father":"paelinck_eduardus_1858","mother":"vanbogaert_maria_1861","spouses":[{"id":"dekeyser_jerome_1897","name":"Jerome Joseph Dekeyser","detail":"m. Sint-Niklaas, 10 Dec 1919"}],"source":"Birth registration nr. 997 — Philomena Leonia Paelinck, Sint-Niklaas, 31 October 1901; Birth act of Philomena Leonia Paelinck, Sint-Niklaas, 31 October 1901; stefpaelinck (Stef Paelinck)","note":"Source detail: Stef Paelinck (stefpaelinck) tree; Sint-Niklaas marriage 1919\n\nFrom Sint-Niklaas — she opens the deep Paelinck line, documented to ~1618.\n\nDOCUMENTED DATE (July 2026). Her birth act — Sint-Niklaas, **31 October 1901** — gives\nthe day the tree had only as a year, and names both parents in the act itself:\n[[paelinck_eduardus_1858]] and [[vanbogaert_maria_1861]]. Those two links stood on the stefpaelinck tree\nuntil now.\n\nFOUND ON FAMILYSEARCH (July 2026), after AGATHA had been recorded as a NOT FOUND for this\nsame act. Her birth registration — Sint-Niklaas, **31 October 1901**, invoernummer **997** —\nis indexed in *Belgium, East Flanders, Civil Registration, 1541-1950*, with both parents\nattached: [[paelinck_eduardus_1858]] and [[vanbogaert_maria_1861]] ([[S16]]).\n\nThe correction to make here is not to the record but to how it was searched. AGATHA holds\neight Paelinck entries for Sint-Niklaas and no births, and that was written up as though the\nact did not exist. It exists; one archive did not have it.\n\nREGISTER PAGE READ (July 2026). Not the index card this time but the act itself —\nSint-Niklaas births 1901, image 268, act nr. 997 ([[leonie-paelinck-1901-birth-register]]).\nHer names are written out at the close of the act as *Philomena Leonia*, with her father and\nmother named in the body. Confidence raised to `doc` on that reading."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"paelinck_livinus_1618","name":"Livinus Paelinck","dates":"b. ~1618 Lochristi","confidence":"sup","surname":"Paelinck","family":"paelinck","born":"~1618 Lochristi","order":"1618","line":"paelinck","spouses":[{"id":"temmerman_elisabeth_1620","name":"Elisabeth Temmerman","detail":"m. Gent, 18 Jan 1645"}],"source":"stefpaelinck (Stef Paelinck)","note":"Earliest documented Paelinck ancestor; the family was rooted in Lochristi (Oost-Vlaanderen). Married Elisabeth Temmerman at Gent in 1645 (the old '1645' was his marriage year, not a death date)."});
