FamilyTree.person({"id":"vanhecke_willem_1580","name":"Willem van Hecke","dates":"b. ~1580","confidence":"sup","surname":"van Hecke","family":"vanhecke","born":"~1580","order":"1580","line":"bundervoet","spouses":[{"name":"(wife unrecorded)"}],"source":"paulderidder","note":"Father of Joanna (Janneken) van Hecke (~1610–1678), who married Segerius Bundervoet —\nso a direct ancestor, and with a birth about 1580 one of the earliest people in the\ntree.\n\nThe paulderidder chart gives him as her father, born about 1580, with the mother shown\nonly as \"?\". Joanna's record previously said her parents were \"not recorded here\";\nthey were.\n\nWORTH NOTING, NOT YET CLAIMED: Livinus Bundervoet's second wife was a Catharina van\nHecke (~1620–~1670), while his son Segerius married this Joanna van Hecke (~1610).\nTwo van Hecke women marrying father and son suggests one van Hecke family, and\npossibly sisters — but nothing seen so far states a relationship between them, so\nnone is recorded here."});
