FamilyTree.person({"id":"vaniseghem_maria_1913","name":"Maria Florentina Herminia Van Iseghem","dates":"b. 22 Jan 1913 Oostende","confidence":"sup","surname":"Van Iseghem","family":"vaniseghem","sex":"f","born":"22 Jan 1913 Oostende","order":"1913-01-22","line":"van-iseghem","father":"vaniseghem_eduardus_1880","mother":"vincke_emma_1880","source":"West-Vlaamse Burgerlijke Stand — Huwelijken (marriage index), Rijksarchief Brugge/Kortrijk volunteers; West-Vlaamse Burgerlijke Stand — Geboorten (birth index), Rijksarchief Brugge/Kortrijk volunteers","note":"Daughter of [[vaniseghem_eduardus_1880]] and [[vincke_emma_1880]], and [[vaniseghem_joannes_1903]]'s sister. Her own\nmarriage act — Stene nr. 21, 17 August 1935 (vrijwilligersrab Huwelijken index,\n`rab-bs-huwelijken`) — names her parents in full as Eduardus Van Iseghem x Emma Celesta\nVincke, matching this couple exactly; one of five such acts spanning 1920-1935 that all\nconverge on the identical parent-name pair. Index only, not the register image, hence\n`sup`. The marriage act does not give her own birth date.\n\n**Birth date (2026-07-27), NOT INDEPENDENTLY RE-CHECKED.** A birth-index sweep for rows\nnaming [[vincke_emma_1880]] as mother turned up her own row: Oostende act nr. 80, 22 January\n1913 (`rab-bs-geboorten`). The verifier did not itself confirm this date against a second\nact or memorial card, and this same index's \"Date\"/\"Certificate Date\" columns are\nconfirmed elsewhere in this family to be conflated (see `rab-bs-overlijdens`'s note and\nthe corrections on [[vincke_irma_1874]] and [[vincke_jerome_1886]]) — recorded with that caveat\nrather than left out, since the row cites a specific act number.\n\nFRONTIER — her husband. The same index names him **Joseph Louis Zwaenepoel**, but he has\nno record of his own here: this pass is naming [[vaniseghem_eduardus_1880]] and [[vincke_emma_1880]]'s\nchildren, not their in-laws, so his own record is left for objective 2's next pass rather\nthan entered now."});
